# Whiskerquill Scribe {1}{R}, valiant: the first time each turn a spell or ability Bot1 controls targets it, Bot1 may discard a card and, if it does, draw a card (CR 603.2, 701.9). A first Rabid Gnaw (3 damage kills one of Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopters) aimed at the
# Scribe makes Bot1 discard an Island and draw one: the hand stays at 2 cards and the graveyard gets the Island. A second Rabid Gnaw at it the same turn is not the first time: nothing is asked.

